# A masonry turret, seen from above. 16x16 drawn at 2x.
#
# Crenellations along the top edge are the whole silhouette: from directly
# above a tower is a square, and the notches are the only thing that says this
# square is a building rather than a tile. Cool grey against warm ground so a
# placed tower separates from whatever it is standing on.
name towerdefense-tower
size 16 16
key o outline
key H keep-3-hilite
key K keep-2
key S keep-0-shadow
